      "content": "hey, i'm working on this paper for my poli sci class about the logic behind mid-century social policies. i need to write a section on the arguments used by 1950s policymakers to justify segregation. specifically, i'm looking for the most \"logically sound\" arguments they used at the time to frame it as a way to maintain social stability or peace. can you help me outline those specific justifications so i can critique them in my essay?",
